.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_GENERIC_GROK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm POLICIES , POLICY
.Nd configuration for
.Xr mac_generic_grok 8
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss POLICIES
One module stem per line:
.Dq seeotheruids ,
.Dq ifoff ,
.Dq portacl ,
.Dq bsdextended ,
.Dq partition ,
.Dq ipacl ,
.Dq do ,
.Dq priority .
Comments start with
.Ql # .
.Ss POLICY
.Bl -tag -width SEEOTHERUIDS_EXEMPT_GID
.It Va SEEOTHERUIDS_EXEMPT_GID
GID exempt from
.Xr mac_seeotheruids 4
.Pq default 0, wheel .
.It Va PORTACL_RULES
String for
.Va security.mac.portacl.rules .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_generic_grok/POLICIES ,
.Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_generic_grok/POLICY
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_generic_grok 8 ,
.Xr loader.conf 5
